WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A missing private DNS zone link sends traffic to the public endpoint. Terraform fixes it.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Architecture: Network view.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Architecture: Name resolution: broken vs fixed.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Broken state: the app spoke follows the public CNAME and gets a public IP, so the private endpoint is bypassed and storage returns 403.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The data spoke works. Comparing the two shows the privatelink.blob zone is linked to hub and data only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Terraform adds the missing VNet link. The same lookup from the app spoke now returns the private endpoint IP.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The check expected a private answer and now passes.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Verified result. Source, tests and setup steps are linked below.
